  "closure_limitation": "The five accepted source-font programs, their exact byte hashes, and an isolated Fontconfig inventory are captured, and two independent renders regenerated every derivative byte-identically on the reviewed macOS host. This is same-host evidence only: renderer executable and dependency bytes, operating-system services, and authenticated acquisition chains are not captured, so the record is not a hermetic or cross-host reproducibility proof.",
