  "claim_boundary": "Each tracked PDF is the reviewed static build input for its named SVG. Digest equality and the embedded-font checks do not by themselves prove visual or semantic equivalence to the SVG, cross-host reproducibility, accessibility, legal compliance in every redistribution scenario, source-font authenticity, or supply-chain integrity. The input programs are not tracked; the PDFs contain renderer-produced embedded subsets. License identifiers, observed program notices, and exact local license/manifest evidence are recorded and digest-bound without authenticating a package, download, or upstream history and without making a legal determination. Any source or derivative change requires exact regeneration, structural checks, rendering, and human visual review. The 1 MiB check is an early raw derivative byte cap only; it is not a hostile-input resource sandbox or decoded-stream-size bound.",
